Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,To think we'd be trounced so thoroughly...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's Ike, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Isaac's like a child--he just wants\Nto strut around with his new toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Has everyone evacuated?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's underway. Have patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Elliot... Karen...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Ike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You've sure made a violent entrance\Nfor visiting an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.69,0:00:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want much--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,just to bring you\Nand Karen back to DEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.99,0:01:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, you'll just\Nhave to play with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.42,0:01:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Beelzebub.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So be it. You've never been\None to listen to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.59,0:01:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.55,0:01:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think of it,\Nthis is the first time we've faced off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm shaking in my boots\Nat the very thought of it, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's Mukuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.93,0:03:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.27,0:03:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Lataib.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy Protect Territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:04:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can reach her without a spacesuit.\NShido, it's do or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it. Send me to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.34,0:04:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the enemy. Four DEM ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.76,0:04:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Goetia... She got us good\Nbefore history was changed, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to get a shot at revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy Dual Territory:\NSpatial Control and Defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Sir!\N--Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to teleport.\NMukuro's all yours, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me! Stay safe, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Shido, correct? I told you:\NMuku doesn't want to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't come to talk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here for the real Mukuro\Nwhose heart isn't locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Muku who locked Muku's own heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:05:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would you lock your own heart?\NWhat happened that--?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free to disregard my warning
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,just as Muku is free\Nto deal with you as I see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let my big brother get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. We're using Territory to detect\Nand dodge incoming objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't over-rely on it.\NYou won't last getting hit by an Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it! Thanks, Kotori! MARIA!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Haniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. I see...\NAn Angel you stole from a Spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mean to say I stole it.\NI'm borrowing it to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaleidoscope!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro, I'm gonna open\Nyour heart with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, Bandersnatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not all! This response...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.22,0:06:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Artemisia Ashcroft.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll fight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.14,0:06:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make the wind blow,\Neven here in the airless sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreement. We won't sit around\Nand do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So be it. I was hoping to keep\Nyou guys out of the fight, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,MARIA, it's time for {\i1}that{\i}.\NOrigami can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,An emergency arming device...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,AW-111, Brunhild. It's our latest model.\NPut it to good use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:07:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Territory hit! No damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a greeting first?\NNow that's a low blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.23,0:07:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Receiving transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We meet again, Kotori Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want, Ellen Mathers?\NFor us to surrender?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. I see you have a new ship,\Nbut it's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just wreck it {\i1}again{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. They must know, too:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,that in the other world,\NFraxinus was destroyed by Goetia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Beelzebub's power is impressive.\NYour boss must be in good spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Good spirits, you say?\NThat's not far from the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.73,0:07:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Otherwise, he wouldn't be\Ninvading enemy bases himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What did you say?\NIke attacked Ratatoskr?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:07:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? I thought you were close,\Nbut I guess he doesn't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm lying, go check yourself.\NOr are you scared to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to rile me up won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll simply check after the battle\Nis over. It won't take five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy moving to surround.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.23,0:08:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Change of plans: only Tohka and Origami\Ngo out. Everyone else, standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Opinion. We can help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a plan.\NFor now, just do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, my dear rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.13,0:08:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the power\Nof the new Fraxinus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.09,0:08:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, shall we begin our date?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:08:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Lataib.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Zadkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange. Are you truly human?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I tell myself, at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Artemisia Ashcroft!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'll be taking that Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,--You okay, Shido?\N--Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Thanks, Tohka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Zadkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.61,0:09:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Fall back, Tohka!\N--Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Kotori, can you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Artemisia, why are you with DEM?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense for you\Nto be friendly with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. With you around,\Nit seems I can't finish my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'll have to destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're strong. Way stronger than me...\Nas a Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... You were there\Nwhen I came for Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.05,0:11:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. If you're a Spirit,\NI can kill you without guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy Yggdrafolium one through ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Converging magic power cannon,\NMistilteinn! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of Fraxinus' new powers.\NModeled off Goetia, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power and maneuverability\Nhave certainly increased.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,However, those who challenge Heaven\Nwill have their wings plucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Be scorched by the flames of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said we only had one trump card?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys. My Spirit power\Nalone wouldn't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. I'm glad to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When we come together, we're unbeatable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like all our Spirit powers\Nare mixing together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about that\Nmakes me really happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,System Blōt:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.13,0:13:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,a new weapon driven by Spirit power\Nwhich surpasses the limits of Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, victory is ours!\NBite the dust, World's Strongest Wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the small fry are left!\NLet's clean 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still here?\NYou really don't learn, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you:\NI came to unlock to your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,--Let's go, Tohka!\N--Mm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. I knew you'd try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but it's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.61,0:14:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.28,0:14:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding...\NWho are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A neighborhood high schooler. Lataib!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad--combining Spirit power\Nand generative magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Goetia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost. Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're wrong.\NOur goal... is to take out the Spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Zadkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--Shido!\N--Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Mukuro!\NI'll protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm going to be\Nyour new mother. And this is Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be your sister, so let's get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,--Shido!\N--Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,--Boy!\N--Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.35,0:16:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Shido? You're crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's just from a dream I had.\NWhere is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.52,0:16:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fraxinus' infirmary. It wasn't easy\Ncatching you out of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah... And Mukuro?!\NWhat about Mukuro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know. During the fall,\Nyou got separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?! Then--!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Muku is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--Mukuro?!\N--Mukuro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mean guy, making Muku wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.05,0:16:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's fine. I'm in a good mood now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Uh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.93,0:16:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a sourpuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this because your heart opened up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Convinced. And her emotions have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Even if that's true...\NMukuro, you're so different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.07,0:16:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it odd for Muku's heart to be touched
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,by the one who worked hard to open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment it was unlocked,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.13,0:17:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt grateful for\Neverything you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, the reason I'm fond of you is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.72,0:17:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, just because. I feel like\Nyou and Muku are close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Close?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, since it seems\Nyou haven't recovered yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall return tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you tomorrow, Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't see that coming! That was Mukuchin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.29,0:17:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Her personality's nothing like I heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise. I had imagined\Na very rude Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:18:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But what a cutie. Her body is tiny,\Nbut she's big where it counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling is such a perv!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.77,0:18:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she'll come tomorrow.\NWhat then, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.28,0:18:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.90,0:18:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, enough! We'll discuss that later.\NShido's still healing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship has some new facilities.\NWhy don't you go soothe your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"New facilities"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:33.13,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Bath"\N"Fraxinus"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A bath imbued with magic, huh?\NIt's true--I do feel great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But what was that dream all about?\NThat little girl was...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:19:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Washing yourself while injured\Nwon't be easy. I'll help, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa! I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.\NI'll lick--wash you clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You just said, "lick"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling! I came to wash your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.01,0:19:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, feeling better?! I'm here to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.59,0:19:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Liking the healing bath?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Reminisce. When it comes to bathing\Ntogether, you want the Yamai Sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys! Shido came here to heal,\Nso let's not forget that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly, all of us didn't need to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But bathing with everyone will be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! How about you and Yoshino\Nwash each other's backs?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.54,0:19:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You wouldn't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew! All these cuties\Nmake for such a nice view!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.09,0:20:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ike!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We may have shook hands a bit too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Elliot was incredibly\Nglad to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.73,0:20:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, it's true?\NYou attacked Ratatoskr's base?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. But unfortunately,\NI let Elliot slip away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And your little sister, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, with Realizers,\NI'll be on my feet tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't fare so well, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to my shortcomings. I deserve\Nwhatever punishment comes my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Ike, you owe me an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me about Elliot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.39,0:20:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had brought you, wouldn't you have\Nkilled Elliot without question?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.07,0:21:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but where am I meeting Mukuro?\NAm I going back to space?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the big question. She said\Nshe'd come back, so we think she will...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time, Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.92,0:21:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here on the surface,\Njust like you wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.11,0:21:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You said there're lots of\Nfun things to do here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's get going, Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.45,0:21:54.96,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 06:\N'An Opened Heart.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.26,0:23:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido has opened Mukuro's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,As a new battle begins,\Na new Origami and Tohka awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.89,0:23:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Locked Memories."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.10,0:23:39.94,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 07: 'Locked Memories.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.89,0:23:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Be tasty! Moé Moé Kyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.64,0:23:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.65,0:23:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
